---

<section class="band alt" id="how">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">
      <h2>Add. Gather. Share.</h2>
      <p>
        Bring in the people you're close to, group them the way your life is grouped, and share with exactly who
        should see it.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="tile" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mini">
            <div class="field">sana@gmail.com</div>
            <div class="opts">
              <span>Parent</span><span class="on">Sibling</span><span>Spouse</span><span>Cousin</span>
            </div>
            <div class="go">Send request</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3><span class="n">01</span>Add your family</h3>
        <p>Invite relatives and say how you're related. They join your tree once they accept.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="tile" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mini">
            <span class="cap">College friends · invite code</span>
            <div class="code">K7MQ-2XPA</div>
            <div class="go">Share code</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3><span class="n">02</span>Start a circle</h3>
        <p>For college, school or work. Share a code and people join themselves.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="tile" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mini">
            <span class="cap">VISIBLE TO</span>
            <div class="aud on"><i></i>Immediate family</div>
            <div class="aud"><i></i>Whole tree</div>
            <div class="aud"><i></i>College friends</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3><span class="n">03</span>Share with who you choose</h3>
        <p>Every photo goes to one audience. Nobody else sees it, its likes or its comments.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .steps {
    margin-top: 48px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .step {
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
    align-content: start;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .tile {
    height: 230px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
    background: var(--panel);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: 16.5px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  .n {
    font: 500 12.5px var(--mono);
    color: var(--accent-ink);
  }
  .step p {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: 14.5px;
  }
  .mini {
    width: 78%;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: #0a0b11;
    border: 1px solid #22232c;
    padding: 12px;
    color: #f0eeeb;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .cap {
    color: #9a9ba5;
    font-size: 10.5px;
  }
  .field {
    padding: 8px 10px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: #191a21;
    border: 1px solid #e25e00;
  }
  .opts {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 5px;
  }
  .opts span {
    padding: 3px 9px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid #2c2d35;
    color: #9a9ba5;
    font-size: 10.5px;
  }
  .opts span.on {
    border-color: #e25e00;
    background: rgba(226, 94, 0, 0.18);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .go {
    padding: 8px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: #e25e00;
    color: #fff;
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .code {
    font: 600 22px var(--mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: #fca676;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 6px 0;
  }
  .aud {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1px solid #272830;
  }
  .aud.on {
    border-color: #e25e00;
    background: rgba(226, 94, 0, 0.1);
  }
  .aud i {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid #3a3b45;
  }
  .aud.on i {
    border: 4px solid #e25e00;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .steps {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
